        "filing_date": "2025-08-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we provide our products directly to patients and bill third-party payers such as Medicare, Medicaid, and insurance companies, we are a “covered entity” and must comply with these standards.",
